   "enthalpy_mush_liquid_fraction": {
    "description": "Enthalpy of the mush from temperature and liquid fraction (enthalpy_mush_liquid_fraction, icepack_mushy_physics.F90:293-307): zqin = phi*(cp_ocn*rhow - cp_ice*rhoi)*zTin + rhoi*cp_ice*zTin - (1-phi)*rhoi*Lfresh (F90:304-305). Used for the congelation-ice enthalpy qbotm = enthalpy_mush_liquid_fraction(Tbot, phi_i_mushy) (icepack_therm_vertical.F90:1413); phi_i_mushy = 0.45 in the D-class run (ice_in namelist, default 0.85 icepack_parameters.F90:139). Constants as in the D-class CESM-coupled run (nuopc-cap overrides, ice_comp_nuopc.F90:415-450; bugs.md #11; see file description).",
    "params": ["T", "phi"],
    "body": {
