   "enthalpy_of_melting": {
    "description": "Enthalpy of melting of the mush from bulk salinity (enthalpy_of_melting, icepack_mushy_physics.F90:313-325): qm = cp_ocn*rhow*liquidus_temperature_mush(zSin) (F90:323), the energy needed to fully melt the mush; cp_ocn*rhow = 4099896 J/m3/C (the nuopc-cap value, ice_comp_nuopc.F90:415-450; bugs.md #11). This is the ktherm = 2 qmlt of thickness_changes (icepack_therm_vertical.F90:1283), zero in the BL99 formulation.",
    "params": ["S"],
    "body": {
     "op": "*",
     "args": [
      {"op": "const", "args": [], "value": 4099896.0, "units": "J/m^3/degC"},
      {
       "op": "apply_expression_template",
       "args": [],
       "name": "liquidus_temperature_mush",
       "bindings": {
        "Sbr": "S"
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   "enthalpy_brine": {
    "description": "Enthalpy of the brine (fully liquid) from temperature (enthalpy_brine, icepack_mushy_physics.F90:330-342): qbr = cp_ocn*rhow*zTin (F90:340); cp_ocn*rhow = 4099896 J/m3/C (the nuopc-cap value, ice_comp_nuopc.F90:415-450; bugs.md #11).",
    "params": ["T"],
    "body": {
     "op": "*",
     "args": [
      {"op": "const", "args": [], "value": 4099896.0, "units": "J/m^3/degC"},
      "T"
     ]
    }
   },
   "icepack_mushy_temperature_mush": {
    "description": "Temperature of the mush from enthalpy and bulk salinity (icepack_mushy_temperature_mush, icepack_mushy_physics.F90:348-452): the piecewise quadratic of the Assur liquidus inverted against the enthalpy, zTin = (-B + sqrt(max(B^2 - 4 A C, puny)))/(2 A) (F90:447) with A, B, C the quadratic coefficients of the higher/lower temperature regions selected by the break enthalpy qb = D_liq*zSin + E_liq (F90:433-445), and the fully-melted branch zTin = zqin*I_liq when zqin exceeds the just-melted enthalpy q0 of the salinity-dependent rational F1/G1/H1/F2/G2/H2 form (F90:427-430, 450). Constants (computed from the az/bz liquidus parameters of F90:36-55 and the D-class run cp/rho values as in F90:388-424, with cp_ocn = 3996, cp_ice = 2117.27, rhow = 1026, rhoi = 917, Lfresh = 333700, cprho = cp_ocn*rhow = 4099896 -- the nuopc-cap overrides of ice_comp_nuopc.F90:415-450, bugs.md #11; verified against the dumped zTin to round-off): AS1 = -39886.4818968, AC1 = -35879596.1832, BS1 = -3496574.182, BQ1 = 18.48, BC1 = 5654933592.0, CS1 = 306002900.0, CQ1 = 0.0, CC1 = 0.0; AS2 = -22249.447977985, AC2 = -20014329.938015003, BS2 = -861389.8574660001, BQ2 = 10.3085, BC2 = 3275582777.866, CS2 = 325097480.96, CQ2 = -62.4, CC2 = -19094580960.0; D_liq = 2341133.53765668, E_liq = -320829049.8153338; F1 = 221855844.15584415, G1 = -1000.0, H1 = 0.0; F2 = 397719939.8554591, G2 = -1000.0, H2 = 24817724.246980645; I_liq = 2.439086259749028e-07; Tb_liq = -7.6362968855167352, Sb_liq = 123.66702800276086. The ifelse replaces the Fortran merges (S_low, q_melt, t_high) with the same selections; the discriminant guard max(B^2 - 4 A C, puny) keeps the sqrt real as in F90:447.",
    "params": ["qin", "S"],
    "body": {
     "op": "ifelse",
     "args": [
