   "shortwave_band_weights": {
    "description": "Broadband albedo of the dEdd scheme from the four band albedos (the history albedos albice/albsno/albpnd of shortwave_dEdd, icepack_shortwave.F90:1496-1498, 1544-1546, 1583-1585): al = awtvdr*alvdr + awtidr*alidr + awtvdf*alvdf + awtidf*alidf with the band weights awtvdr = 0.00318 (visible, direct), awtidr = 0.00182 (near-IR, direct), awtvdf = 0.63282 (visible, diffuse), awtidf = 0.36218 (near-IR, diffuse) (icepack_parameters.F90:218-221).",
    "params": ["alvdr", "alidr", "alvdf", "alidf"],
